[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2483620803","pull_request_review_id":3407427849,"id":2483620803,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6UCQvD","diff_hunk":"@@ -167,6 +167,12 @@ class XRInterface : public RefCounted {\n \tvirtual RID get_vrs_texture(); /* obtain VRS texture */\n \tvirtual VRSTextureFormat get_vrs_texture_format() { return XR_VRS_TEXTURE_FORMAT_UNIFIED; }\n \n+\t/** protected content **/\n+\t// If enabled, protect content from CPU access. This returns false if the feature is not available.\n+\tvirtual bool set_protected_content(bool p_protected_content) { return false; }\n+\t// Returns true if the content is being protected from CPU access.\n+\tvirtual bool is_protected_content() const { return false; }","path":"servers/xr/xr_interface.h","commit_id":"52336b67eb7afeb0220bf92044b9e803612c18d1","original_commit_id":"52336b67eb7afeb0220bf92044b9e803612c18d1","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm a little unsure about adding this to `XRInterface` (as opposed to just making it specific to `OpenXRInterface`).\r\n\r\nDo we know how any other XR APIs handle this?\r\n\r\nI took a look at WebXR, and there isn't anything currently to protect the projection layer (only media composition layers, but it's done a little indirectly, and it looks like it ends up relying on DRM-related web APIs outside of WebXR to decide if the layer is protected). But if it added this feature later, I'm not 100% sure it's something we'd be able to turn on/off while a session is running or without user interaction\r\n\r\nMy inclination would be to just put this on `OpenXRInterface` for now, and then we can move it up to `XRInterface` later if we want (which wouldn't break GDExtension compatibility).\r\n\r\nSpeaking of GDExtension, if we _do_ end up adding this to `XRInterface`, it needs to be added to `XRInterfaceExtension` as well","created_at":"2025-11-01T11:05:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-01T11:08:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112273#discussion_r2483620803","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112273","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2483620803"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112273#discussion_r2483620803"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112273"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2483620803/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":171,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":174,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":8,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2483624484","pull_request_review_id":3407427849,"id":2483624484,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6UCRok","diff_hunk":"@@ -140,6 +140,7 @@ class OpenXRAPI {\n \tXrFrameState frame_state = { XR_TYPE_FRAME_STATE, nullptr, 0, 0, false };\n \tdouble render_target_size_multiplier = 1.0;\n \tRect2i render_region;\n+\tbool protected_content;","path":"modules/openxr/openxr_api.h","commit_id":"2be7d65da7df02f6e9e9bad49a9acd638c2e03b0","original_commit_id":"52336b67eb7afeb0220bf92044b9e803612c18d1","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\r\n\tbool protected_content = false;\r\n```","created_at":"2025-11-01T11:07:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-01T11:08:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112273#discussion_r2483624484","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112273","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2483624484"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112273#discussion_r2483624484"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112273"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2483624484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"s